nd we had a  lot of other great events as well you  know all sorts of things coming onto  podcasts and shows and you know giving  talks uh invited here and there so that  was a lot of fun  and uh what else should I mention well  you know it's been a year of a lot of  cooking and uh family and you know  reading and writing and all of these  sorts of things that are that are quite  important  um our city here is growing and  developing and despite the attempts by  some of the legislators in Wisconsin to  choke the crap out of it it's  doing pretty well we elected a new mayor  who is helming things quite quite well  and you know all sorts of other good  things happening in this this region as  well so you know 22s 2022 has been kind  of a mixed year but I would say at least  for you know uh me and my immediate  family overall a pretty good year and so  I hope that you're 2022 was good for you  and uh look forward to you know hearing  what you have to say about the year and  about the different things that I just  mentioned or that you want to know more  about and I'll see all of you hopefully  uh down the line somewhere either in the  ether the internet the interwebs or  maybe even face to face this year of  2023.
 

